OL,3,GNEWSAChemo services to return to
OL,4,Acommunity hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FChemotherapy services are expected to
OL,7,Fbe reinstated at a community hospital
OL,8,Fthree-and-a-half years after the unit
OL,9,Fclosed, a hospital charity has said.
OL,11,FAbout 60 cancer patients were affected
OL,12,Fwhen the unit at Wareham Hospital,
OL,13,FDorset, shut in 2023, with many facing
OL,14,Fjourneys to Poole or Dorchester for
OL,15,Ftreatment.
OL,17,FFollowing a campaign by health groups,
OL,18,Fthe Friends of Wareham Hospital and
OL,19,FSouth Dorset MP Lloyd Hatton, the
OL,20,Fservice is expected to resume in early
OL,21,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
