OL,3,GNEWSAChemo services to return to
OL,4,Acommunity hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends of Wareham Hospital, a charity
OL,7,Fsupporting the hospital and local
OL,8,Fhealth services, is now raising funds
OL,9,Fto buy two scalp coolers, which help
OL,10,Freduce hair loss for patients receiving
OL,11,Ftreatment.
